{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X少数压缩后的句子改变了原本的心理意味，例如「互相依靠」「让对方安心」「如今不后悔」，不如Y对人物动机和情绪转折交代得准确自然。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边看的观众，X的短句分层、重点放大和感受词按音乐时机出现，让我更容易迅速抓住每段发生了什么，也更容易把文字和音乐中的细微变化对应起来。Y的完整叙述在人物动机、心理因果和前后情绪衔接上更自然，少了一些压缩造成的意义偏移。总体我选X，因为它在实际观看时更容易扫读、抓重点，而且音乐感受的层次和具体程度更丰富；但X需要注意不要为了压缩而牺牲原本准确的心理表达。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b8cafb25-9d7f-4845-804f-abc716c2ef05", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T182715038207Z", "elapsed_seconds": 97.469, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:28:52.532829+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e92ae9dc4a3b2e11019d697dd9bc16f80b18d12fe21eeb95ff92df8f78470962", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools